# Hardhat Ignition writes a deployment journal and a full solc build-info blob
# per chain. Local dev chains (1337/31337) are recreated by `npx hardhat node`
# every time, so their records are throwaway -- one was 6.3MB of committed
# noise. Real testnet/mainnet deployments ARE worth committing, so those are
# re-included below.
ignition/deployments/chain-*
